<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>WSL on Ricky</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/wsl/</link><description>Recent content in WSL on Ricky</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Wed, 30 Dec 2020 21:24:12 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://linzeyan.github.io/categories/wsl/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>WSL 2 .wslconfig configuration explained</title><link>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2020/20201230-e4619f17e8d252b9ff72579ac271881c/</link><pubDate>Wed, 30 Dec 2020 21:24:12 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://linzeyan.github.io/posts/2020/20201230-e4619f17e8d252b9ff72579ac271881c/</guid><description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://gist.github.com/doggy8088/e4619f17e8d252b9ff72579ac271881c" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;WSL 2 .wslconfig configuration explained&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/windows/wsl/release-notes#build-18945" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Release Notes for Windows Subsystem for Linux | Microsoft Docs - Build 18945&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.huanlintalk.com/2020/02/wsl-2-installation.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Install WSL 2 on Windows 10&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="https://blog.miniasp.com/post/2020/07/26/Multiple-Linux-Dev-Environment-build-on-WSL-2#google_vignette" target="_blank" rel="noopener"&gt;Build a multi-Linux development environment with WSL 2&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Steps to install WSL 2:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join the Windows Insider Program (required)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enable required WSL components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install a Linux distribution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set the Linux distribution to use WSL 2&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;WSL 2 troubleshooting: compressed virtual disk files cannot be converted to the WSL 2 architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install and start Docker&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Install Docker Desktop v2.2.1.0&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-5837df67ba29d1c824a2736230bf5f58-0"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-powershell" data-lang="powershell"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Enable required WSL components&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;dism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="py"&gt;exe&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;online&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;enable-feature&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;featurename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;Microsoft-Windows&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;-Subsystem-Linux&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;all&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;norestart&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;dism&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="py"&gt;exe&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;online&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;enable-feature&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;featurename&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="err"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;VirtualMachinePlatform&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;all&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;norestart&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c"&gt;# Set the Linux distribution to WSL 2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;wsl&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;-set-version&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="n"&gt;ubuntu&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;wsl&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;-&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;-set-default-version&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="mf"&gt;2&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"# Enable required WSL components\ndism.exe /online /enable-feature /featurename:Microsoft-Windows-Subsystem-Linux /all /norestart\ndism.exe /online /enable-feature /featurename:VirtualMachinePlatform /all /norestart\n\n# Set the Linux distribution to WSL 2\nwsl --set-version ubuntu 2\nwsl --set-default-version 2\n","title":"powershell"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Edit &lt;code&gt;%UserProfile%\.wslconfig&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Command Prompt&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-5837df67ba29d1c824a2736230bf5f58-1"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-sh" data-lang="sh"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;notepad %UserProfile%&lt;span class="se"&gt;\.&lt;/span&gt;wslconfig
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"notepad %UserProfile%\\.wslconfig\n","title":"sh"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Windows PowerShell&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-5837df67ba29d1c824a2736230bf5f58-2"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-ps1" data-lang="ps1"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="n"&gt;notepad&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nv"&gt;$env:USERPROFILE&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;\.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="py"&gt;wslconfig&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"notepad $env:USERPROFILE\\.wslconfig\n","title":"ps1"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Configuration reference&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code-block" data-code-block&gt;&lt;div class="code-block-full" id="code-block-5837df67ba29d1c824a2736230bf5f58-3"&gt;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-ini" data-lang="ini"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="k"&gt;[wsl2]&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;kernel&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;lt;path&amp;gt; # An absolute Windows path to a custom Linux kernel.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;memory&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;lt;size&amp;gt; # How much memory to assign to the WSL2 VM.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;processors&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;lt;number&amp;gt; # How many processors to assign to the WSL2 VM.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;swap&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;lt;size&amp;gt; # How much swap space to add to the WSL2 VM. 0 for no swap file.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;swapFile&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;lt;path&amp;gt; # An absolute Windows path to the swap vhd.&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="na"&gt;localhostForwarding&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s"&gt;&amp;lt;bool&amp;gt; # Boolean specifying if ports bound to wildcard or localhost in the WSL2 VM should be connectable from the host via localhost:port (default true).&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# &amp;lt;path&amp;gt; entries must be absolute Windows paths with escaped backslashes, for example C:\\Users\\Ben\\kernel&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="c1"&gt;# &amp;lt;size&amp;gt; entries must be size followed by unit, for example 8GB or 512MB&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;script type="application/json" class="code-block-data"&gt;{"copyButton":true,"expanded":false,"labels":{"code":"Code","copied":"Copied!","copy":"Copy","copyError":"Copy failed. Try again.","showAll":"Show all {count} lines","showLess":"Show fewer lines"},"language":"","preview":"","source":"[wsl2]\nkernel=\u003cpath\u003e # An absolute Windows path to a custom Linux kernel.\nmemory=\u003csize\u003e # How much memory to assign to the WSL2 VM.\nprocessors=\u003cnumber\u003e # How many processors to assign to the WSL2 VM.\nswap=\u003csize\u003e # How much swap space to add to the WSL2 VM. 0 for no swap file.\nswapFile=\u003cpath\u003e # An absolute Windows path to the swap vhd.\nlocalhostForwarding=\u003cbool\u003e # Boolean specifying if ports bound to wildcard or localhost in the WSL2 VM should be connectable from the host via localhost:port (default true).\n\n# \u003cpath\u003e entries must be absolute Windows paths with escaped backslashes, for example C:\\\\Users\\\\Ben\\\\kernel\n# \u003csize\u003e entries must be size followed by unit, for example 8GB or 512MB\n","title":"ini"}&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Related links&lt;/p&gt;
